        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-4000] If EVCC is using ServiceName = DC_ACDP, the following requirements are not applicable: [V2G20-1540], [V2G20-2301], [V2G20-2624] and [V2G20-1028].",
