                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2622] If the check as described by [V2G20-2545] succeeds, i.e. this V2G communication session resumption request came from the same EVCC with which the SECC had setup this particular V2G communication session, the SECC shall continue with V2G session resumption.",
